+# Proposed outline — Engineering with AI: Beyond Vibe Coding
+
+Status: PROPOSED; author approval required. M0 candidate, 2026-10-31.
+The original OUTLINE.md was not supplied. Do not apply over a restored original.
+Twelve chapter slots are an option, not an accepted chapter-count decision.
+
+1. Engineering decisions when AI participates
+2. Specifications, context and evidence
+3. The common case and comparison protocol
+4. BMAD Method
+5. GSD framework lineage
+6. AWS AI-DLC
+7. AI Unified Process
+8. One change, four artifact trails
+9. Repair, maintenance and specification drift
+10. Quality, operations and team decision rights
+11. Choosing and adapting a process
+12. Running your own evaluation
+
+SDD is cross-cutting. Tools and IDEs are implementation context.
+Method order is not a ranking. Snapshot/profile choices remain open.
+Slot 8 uses walkthrough evidence if controlled trials are infeasible.
+Appendices may hold dated setup recipes, glossary, scorecards and source notes.
+No chapter abstracts, word budgets, manuscript prose or results are approved.
